  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ロトムが　すきな　かでんが　のっている。\nカタログを　つかうことで　ロトムを\nかでんに　いれたり　だすことが　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "로토무가 좋아하는 가전제품이 실려 있다.\n카탈로그를 사용하면 로토무를\n가전제품에 넣거나 꺼낼 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "記載著洛托姆喜歡的電器。\n透過使用這本型錄，可以讓\n洛托姆進入或離開電器。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un catalogue présentant divers appareils ménagers\nque Motisma apprécie. À utiliser pour faire entrer\nMotisma dans ces appareils ou l’en faire sortir.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Katalog, der Rotoms Lieblingsgeräte auflistet.\nMit diesem Katalog kann Rotom in Geräte schlüpfen\nund sie wieder verlassen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un catálogo de los artilugios favoritos de Rotom que le\npermite introducirse o salir fácilmente de los mismos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Contiene una lista degli apparecchi che piacciono\na Rotom. Può essere usato per far entrare Rotom\nnel motore degli elettrodomestici o per farlo uscire.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A catalog of devices that Rotom like. Use the catalog\nto have Rotom hop in and out of the various devices\nlisted within.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ロトムが　好きな　家電が　載っている。\nカタログを　使うことで　ロトムを\n家電に　いれたり　だすことが　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "上面记载着洛托姆喜欢的家电。\n通过使用这本指南，可以\n让洛托姆潜入或脱离家电。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un catálogo de los artilugios favoritos de Rotom que le\npermite introducirse o salir fácilmente de los mismos.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
